: italic;"&gt;摄影师：法新社/盖蒂图片社&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;在有报道称&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/xwqfDmi5eLT60DTVijne-K05qzH2iVuYmZgH4PXpqMxit78VT2LmGYyzuY43Erx2hVUI7cCinXItHirZKE5Bw1tiZK0B4qdD5rBhOCttlhvTQw3mB6lt9lokIC1w7U-IyPreOhPLJ-n_SNR7ellxY8bsKSQ_S5AIU-dUKo1U1wjBG4VChTAWYiJGLyCgiPJbMU0RPdMBFWtThhZxIhTFYb6zy1ZCTYh4Ibsb_EGgg1NuXyBPj7FGgu3nK_19b8KRbwcTSjdwBOoe6zaE9n7NoDaDobOfZF9fAtodvw3bPup1-SI4TfJSpy86iL6o2y_LmJqKqryAweMKhE-T9EPf14SUk87VVU8e1HaHKGXopKajiuo4K7IrW8uUKOGwPw7GC1OtfKoIMTTuwAr3TBX6oTMlLLEZAouNxVnqfsoOnUCjYfaC01MZiBFqAk1d9bbozQBvNVo5AbwDqBHe9lb-23lWoQVAoaqn2F-OdtmpcTJlMm7a_86LR3oHOfh6GvJ5tj8z4nEBxbNmiu6F0LPE92aJ5pLtLEkDl5T5V8Xz10ZY3g/jTxp8PCNa9QpH93LF3ocWqHKwRsucWLL/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="俄罗斯利用英国无人机袭击乌克兰威胁英国"&gt;基辅使用英国公司制造的无人机&lt;/a&gt;在俄罗斯境内发动袭击后，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;俄罗斯警告称，&lt;/strong&gt;英国将面临“必须承担的后果”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;据一家主要商业团体称，今年前六个月，墨西哥报告&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;有超过 6,500 名勒索受害者&lt;/strong&gt;，这是&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/fxKxA8qvv8Wv_ZnhJJ1wHscoNumj0-niQGWptyX9393rbS6UEc5qBECTuVnC-bKcAAGmj7wTLKBl_GPBD4XOEoeav4T7iyZ57zkV4X-A9mHAwQZCVeYWw48d8O7NKr6IRnHHyXao1u1wDvLSdHRQ3gdDEXEDEToPfFhemsybvl-4T5DSPig5H2dZsRIjm8ZXfm7vlC0aFjYNL1XNc0NqBLHSCU3JJuaMPhm9jYk7i7dTQfgVzd59uCraCR1-ojLMwhHjGWab7iEFyBt1iF-G39rSVqcpwXzYKW16RASNrmPzYB65-O0deVrhS-UI8oKOpVkpg-jzbnqQHETE_I42auc_6qgereMXCmI5zfdnO2mANwkQivZ3N4JkrLAH6XQFFX17DUV38jMWsm8pDN4OiiunZypwLtMrL8jec7EtdWMcIwTbgDvghHsmIvhZOO-Ms4TisQYqX00_WTt53RgE6h9Ply9oV-msxoFvi8n9hgivfLIzuovAW_ffyUoOkEy_T_iAKuV6M96Olz90pWNYYF-2qLwVmPN2XNlmU4ghCHu4/nIQneuAYk25g4Wc-zGXiv6oEJeCVm8NX/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="其他犯罪率下降，墨西哥敲诈勒索水平创 11 年来新高"&gt;十多年来&lt;/a&gt;最严重的水平，这突显了政府越来越多地针对此类犯罪的原因。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ng-HPXxeFEgBkhd4iVlujgOI07HCbFu_vH56GpB-0j5Fa73yFYZJffSGW5qfxMcHF89yL7_HBTJzPvC02eYDAEVIwT357QdLqvBwrku53fVt3hiWFT4MpYOflNW0LUkR1ZJD7DAOEku4-xUbJ18wG2VMfWMG1GeGh8vadVol57m7Vw9ik5ycmbj7okYQPutEDlVftIwnwYB5O-azVrJnQAlkHkuKq-sjGfQSQ0EDWR9k36j4EcmtDLTJu_za8v2oNr6EJUvBN3PnDHt6LzkTiaxz7rhJj7ICw1f-JAVMhJNTFHKCSrpuL2U_lf1dwWU6mhCFXcsPB7AmhSHtfuSjwgMC_fPGWIH96uMhCRhFs65xBVHek0gznbCMwkLCgY6FFyEPnJBdZ0naVZc8JhedkupRMM0n2yG6jJDSq5yU6euQ1QzCcGhR-RqiRY8VSVd-5pG3T4fJfQl1vocVuT_vPffK6-ouURk/mA3QACFU0xn-CvPris7JJmo_W1BjHnNV/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;订阅华盛顿版时事通讯，&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;了解来自美国首都的新闻，并在美国东部时间工作日下午 1 点和 5 点观看彭博电视台的《权力平衡》节目。&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;每日图表&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iVgrekgQbvnE/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" alt="" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="替代" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iVgrekgQbvnE/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;新数据显示中国经济全面疲软，增长可能进一步低于政府年度目标，引发总理李强呼吁加大&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/FmpQKRrVJylxDX5OF6o1aGYFRcn6FDe09NsI0BODNXN3BE0AQ3l5ICpVcPyifoLIxyi6PRVCoX9UO5vkwIVSqG_AkKwdbdsVZqY0QcgbqOmWs-SWI2zFQQvnppnj_rpta45e58FsgzoauCiKRwfJ4LEngBU7wfof-fH3k4-1VlgLMFsDBkp9t6qEMN7CfnihlHPH0K1SC_HsHWWs7yHOYQFXNNba4vRguo5sdL-9AruDhZMx7O07